    <requirement>
        <location>/app/code/src/ctc/binary/hashes.py</location>
        <description>The keccak function in hashes.py fails when hashlib doesn't have keccak_256 due to Python version compatibility issues. The error occurs when trying to compute keccak hashes for address creation and other cryptographic operations.</description>
        <contract>Update the keccak function to properly handle Python version differences by ensuring fallback mechanisms work correctly when hashlib.keccak_256 is not available. The function should gracefully fall back to hashlib.sha3_256 or other compatible hash functions.</contract>
